#: templates/eos_auth_monitor/settings.html:61
msgid ""
"Untick what the Alliance does not use, e.g. Moon Observations and the mining"
" scope for an Alliance without moons. A section and its scope are separate "
"entries."
msgstr ""
"Снимите отметку с того, чем Alliance не пользуется, например Moon "
